OL,3,ARock stars gather on tiny island for
OL,4,AScotland's quirkiest sporting challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FContenders from around the world are
OL,7,Fconverging on a tiny Scottish island
OL,8,Ffor one of the country's most unlikely
OL,9,Finternational sporting events - the
OL,10,Fworld stone skimming championships.
OL,12,FThe annual contest on the isle of
OL,13,FEasdale, in the Inner Hebrides, has
OL,14,Fattracted a record number of
OL,15,Finternational entries, representing
OL,16,Fmore than 30 nations, with some flying
OL,17,Fin from New Zealand and Canada.
OL,19,FLast year's competition was rocked by a
OL,20,Fcheating scandal after some contestants
OL,21,Fwere accused of stone tampering.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
