OL,3,ARock stars gather on tiny island for
OL,4,AScotland's quirkiest sporting challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FToss Master Kyle Mathews, co-organiser
OL,7,Fof the event, said an official
OL,8,Ftournament geologist had been appointed
OL,9,Fthis year, leaving no stone unturned in
OL,10,Fkeeping the 400 challengers in order.
